---
manual: edit_line.change
lines: [3086, 3090]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $seen = []
  @line = edit_line
  @line.change { $seen << @line.text }
end
----------- test code
click_on edit_line
assert_empty $seen

press_key "o"
press_key "k"
press_key :backspace

assert_equal %w[o ok o], $seen, "one change per character typed or deleted"
